<title>HONG KONG: Chungtex Electronic mandates $25 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Chungtex Electronic mandates $25 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chungtex Electronic Co Ltd has mandated Citicorp International to arrange a US$25 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with annual put options.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
